<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Prod, imp, retail prices.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Prod, imp, retail prices.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	 PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Producer prices    Nov	 +0.2 pct m/m, -0.3 y/y  Dec 19-20</p>
<p> Inflation, prelim  Dec/Year  -0.1 pct m/m, +1.4 y/y  Dec 20-23</p>
<p> Import prices	Nov	 +0.6 pct m/m, +1.6 y/y  Dec 20-23</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
